    <li>
      <div class="step-content">
        <strong>Set format to 9:16</strong>
        <p>TikTok and Instagram Reels are vertical. Select <strong>9:16</strong> (1080×1920px) for the best result.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div class="step-content">
        <strong>Customize colors &amp; design</strong>
        <p>Adjust colors, background and animation speed to match your branding or music style.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div class="step-content">
        <strong>Export as MP4</strong>
        <p>Click "Export as MP4" — the video is downloaded directly to your computer.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ol>

