  <h2>Normalize Audio Before Exporting</h2>

  <p>
    For your video to sound great on TikTok, the audio file should be normalized to <strong>-14 LUFS</strong>. TikTok automatically turns down louder files — which often sounds unnatural. Use the <a href="https://kodinitools.com/audionormalisierer/">KodiniTools Audio Normalizer</a> before creating the video.
  </p>

